issue.description:
**PRD:** https://rnd.frontiir.net/en/products/rt/requirements/noc-ticket-automation-prd

**Purpose:** close gaps the #21503 description leaves undefined, so the rule engine and ACs can be finalised.

**Items:**

- (1) line profile mismatch match type: case sensitivity, whitespace trimming, whether null and whitespace-only count as blank (value list NO_INTERNET, SUSPEND, MN_Default_3.00Mbps, blank or N/A is decided);
- (2) whether the 3-day averages (ONU on/off, BIP8 errors, port loss) include today and which dates count;
- (3) whether the 24 h usage window is rolling and whether GB means 10^9 or 2^30 bytes;
- (4) full `phase_state` values (the sample shows only "Working");
- (5) full `errors` code list and meanings, and which codes leave a rule input missing (the sample shows only 2005 on cpe.status and 2008 on 24 h usage; the Workflow Engine config lists 2001-2012, 4001-4004, 5001, 5002). Decided 2026-11-19: only errors on the fields the rules need count; a missing 24 h usage (2008) is a Manual Check.

**Affects:** Stories NOC-AUTO S2, S4, S5 (#22950, #22952, #22953) and S8 (#22956).

**Done when:** each item is answered by the Node-RED owner and the answer is recorded on this Task and in the affected Story ACs or the PRD.
